'' db/sqlite, a module in the toolchain's pkg/ since 2026-10-10: fbsqlite's wrapper, ported
'' from its headers (which include fb/ library headers, gone from tiko) onto the std
'' modules. fbsqlite's own twelve test programs pass against it (631 assertions).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/modules/src/stdfacade/sqlite.bas -o tests/modules/dbsqlite.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/dbsqlite.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: Ada  36
